<title>USA: Fidelity Advisor Emerging to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Advisor Emerging to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Advisor Emerging Asia Fund Inc said on Monday it will conduct a repurchase offer for up to 10 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>The fund will pay net asset value, as determined at close of business on April 14, for shares tendered before March 31.</p>
<p>Fidelity Advisor is a non-diversified, closed-end management investment company. Its stock closed Monday at 14-1/2, unchanged from its close on Friday.</p>
